<title>SPAIN: Spain to approve Repsol sale March 7-source.</title>
<headline>Spain to approve Repsol sale March 7-source.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain is likely to approve the sale of the state's last 10 percent stake in energy group Repsol at Friday's cabinet meeting, a source close to the operation said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We understand that it will be approved tomorrow, in all likelihood,&quot; the source told Reuters.</p>
<p>The 10 percent stake in the firm, around 30 million shares, is managed by state holding company SEPI, and is worth about 160 billion pesetas at the current share price.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
